<section image-layout="blank" id="c53f8YksRC"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="P4D3ip60K5" padding-bottom="16pt"><h2>How long did the conflict last?</h2><p font-size="lg">From <b>1835</b> to <b>1845</b>: ten calendar years.</p><grid spacing="large"><grid-item id="vzLbvlv1Lm" background-color="palette-3" vertical-align="center" colspan="17"><display size="lg">10</display><h3>years</h3><p font-size="18pt">Longer than most children spend in primary school.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="n2poDhb5fu" vertical-align="center" colspan="43"><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="G3tXeUhrk0"><p role="eyebrow">1835 &#xb7; begins</p></grid-item><spacer mode="fill"/><grid-item id="C6fS797G7R"><p role="eyebrow">1845 &#xb7; ends</p></grid-item></grid><custom-code><div style="height:90pt;width:100%"><svg viewBox="0 0 480 85" width="100%" height="100%" role="img" aria-label="Timeline from 1835 to 1845 with equal annual intervals"><line x1="20" y1="22" x2="460" y2="22" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="6"/><line x1="20" y1="22" x2="20" y2="45" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="20" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="16">1835</text><line x1="64" y1="22" x2="64" y2="35" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="64" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="12">1836</text><line x1="108" y1="22" x2="108" y2="35" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="108" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="12">1837</text><line x1="152" y1="22" x2="152" y2="35" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="152" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="12">1838</text><line x1="196" y1="22" x2="196" y2="35" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="196" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="12">1839</text><line x1="240" y1="22" x2="240" y2="35" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="240" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="12">1840</text><line x1="284" y1="22" x2="284" y2="35" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="284" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="12">1841</text><line x1="328" y1="22" x2="328" y2="35" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="328" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="12">1842</text><line x1="372" y1="22" x2="372" y2="35" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="372" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="12">1843</text><line x1="416" y1="22" x2="416" y2="35" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="416" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="12">1844</text><line x1="460" y1="22" x2="460" y2="45" stroke="#2D7180" stroke-width="2"/><text x="460" y="65" text-anchor="middle" fill="#19333A" font-size="16">1845</text></svg></div></custom-code><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="hX05Qq9-Cw" colspan="20"><h4>Start</h4><p font-size="18pt">Political conflict begins.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="FtnrnSzpzW" align="center" colspan="20"><h4 align="center">A long middle</h4><p font-size="18pt" align="center">Families and workers live through years of uncertainty.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="kciizvTgGq" align="right" colspan="20"><h4 align="right">End</h4><p font-size="18pt" align="right">The conflict stops in 1845.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="5LxkSH1FxO" background-color="surface" padding="12pt 18pt"><p font-size="18pt"><b>Duration clue:</b> Each space between ticks is one year. The ruler measures time; it does not mark battles or other events.</p></grid-item></grid><p role="caption">Source: <a href="https://cultura.rs.gov.br/upload/arquivos/carga20210405/27100547-anais-ahrs-v-16-1.pdf">Anais AHRS, vol. 16 (PDF)</a></p></grid-item></grid></section>